{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1787905586,"nonce":"UACiliNfpGYfqeNoi21aI6bW8nQ=","title":"Found while fixing the empty-repo motif (c45071e, 6792531).","message":"The baked ponder scenes share ONE canvas (96x43) so any member of the family\ncan host a bubble wherever its anchor falls. 6792531 fixed the horizontal half\nof that: the box now sizes to the widest occupied column rather than the\ndeclared `cols`, widened by a `place: \"right\"` bubble that legitimately reaches\nfurther, capped at `cols`.\n\nThe vertical equivalent is untouched, and it is the same story:\n\n  ponder-ponder      rows  6..42   6 blank rows on top\n  ponder-nap         rows  6..42   6 blank rows on top\n  ponder-faceplant   rows  6..42   6 blank rows on top\n  ponder-kingofhill  rows  0..42   uses the headroom (its beetle climbs)\n\nSo those 6 rows are RESERVED for the family, not waste — exactly like the 14\ncolumns were. The effect is that the box carries ~29px of dead space above the\nart at fontSize 8, so the motif sits low in its box and pushes the caption\n(`This repo hasn't run yet.`) down. Invisible at fontSize 5, which is why it\nwent unnoticed until the empty state was scaled up.\n\nWhy it was not fixed alongside the width: cropping rows off the TOP needs the\nlayers SHIFTED UP by the offset, not merely a shorter box — `.ascii-scene pre`\nanchors them with `inset: 0` — and the bubble \u003cpre\u003e, positioned from\n`bub.row`, needs the same shift. The width change needed neither, so the two\nare not symmetric in cost.\n\nFix direction: measure the first occupied row the way `contentCols` measures\nthe widest column (same per-scene cache / build-time resolve), set the box\nheight to `(lastRow - firstRow + 1) * cell`, and offset every layer by\n`-firstRow * cell` — replacing `inset: 0` with an explicit top — the bubble\nlayer included. Guard it the way the width is guarded: never crop past what a\nbubble occupies.\n\nFiles: ui/scarab-web-ui/src/components/AsciiScene.tsx\n       ui/scarab-docs-ui/src/components/AsciiScene.astro\n\nOnly worth doing if the empty state stays at fontSize 8 or grows; at 5 the\ndead space is a few pixels.","files":null}]}